description: >
  The unbridled chaos within you swallows order in its entirety, destabilizing reality itself in your presence.
text: >
  Legendary Chaos (4): The unbridled chaos within you swallows order in its entirety, destabilizing reality itself in your presence.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Pure Form gains 2 additional levels of the Scaling Aspect.
  (2)-[1/Encounter]: As an Instant Maneuver, use a Ki Surge. Then, roll your Chaos Die.

